<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-WEST INDIES 156 FOR THREE WICKETS AT CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WEST INDIES 156 FOR THREE WICKETS AT CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>West Indies, chasing Australia's first innings 331, were 156 for three at close of play on the second day of the second test at the Sydney Cricket Ground on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scores - Australia 331 (Greg Blewett 69); West Indies 156 for three (Sherwin Campbell 77).</p>
